{"seconds": 32.1, "exit": 0, "final": "Now I have the full picture. **Best move: exf2+**\n\n**Main line:**\n1. **exf2+** (check, pawn takes on f2)\n2. Kh2 (or Kg2; Bxf2 also loses to Rxe1+)\n3. Rxe1 (Black wins White's rook)\n\n**Motif: discoveredAttack** (moving the e3 pawn opens the e-file for the e8 rook to attack e1) combined with **intermezzo** (an in-between check that forces White's king to move before White can deal with the threats).\n\n**Coaching note:**\n\n---\n\n**\"Check the back ranks!\"** Your e3 pawn was blocking White's rook on e1. By playing **exf2+**, you force White to move his king with check\u2014then his rook on e1 hangs because your rook on e8 now controls the e-file. You win the exchange or a full rook. Always look for pawn moves that open lines for your pieces behind them.\n\n---\n\n```json\n{\"move\": \"exf2+\", \"line\": [\"exf2+\", \"Kh2\", \"Rxe1\", \"Rd8+\", \"Kh7\", \"Nd5\"], \"motifs\": [\"discoveredAttack\", \"intermezzo\"]}\n```", "tool_calls": [{"tool": "skill", "args": {"skill": "chess-coach"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-board", "args": {"fen": "4r1k1/1p4pp/8/8/1Pn5/2NRprBP/5P2/4R1K1 b - - 0 31"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-threats", "args": {"fen": "4r1k1/1p4pp/8/8/1Pn5/2NRprBP/5P2/4R1K1 b - - 0 31"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-line_view", "args": {"fen": "4r1k1/1p4pp/8/8/1Pn5/2NRprBP/5P2/4R1K1 b - - 0 31", "square": "d3"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-line_view", "args": {"fen": "4r1k1/1p4pp/8/8/1Pn5/2NRprBP/5P2/4R1K1 b - - 0 31", "square": "e1"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-line_view", "args": {"fen": "4r1k1/1p4pp/8/8/1Pn5/2NRprBP/5P2/4R1K1 b - - 0 31", "square": "g3"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-line_view", "args": {"fen": "4r1k1/1p4pp/8/8/1Pn5/2NRprBP/5P2/4R1K1 b - - 0 31", "square": "e8"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-square_info", "args": {"fen": "4r1k1/1p4pp/8/8/1Pn5/2NRprBP/5P2/4R1K1 b - - 0 31", "square": "e3"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-legal_moves", "args": {"fen": "4r1k1/1p4pp/8/8/1Pn5/2NRprBP/5P2/4R1K1 b - - 0 31"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args"